{"title":"An account settings page has save profile, discard edits, delete account, and reset password. What is the clearest arrangement?","html":"<main><div class=\"practice-page practice-question practice-term-button\"><div class=\"practice-question-layout\"><section class=\"practice-answer-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"practice-question-title\"><h1 id=\"practice-question-title\">An account settings page has save profile, discard edits, delete account, and reset password. What is the clearest arrangement?</h1><fieldset class=\"practice-options\"><legend class=\"sr-only\">Choose the best answer</legend><button class=\"practice-option\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>A</span><b>Use one Confirm button for every operation and infer the intent afterward</b></button><button class=\"practice-option\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>B</span><b>Use buttons for save, discard, and delete; keep reset password as a link and confirm deletion</b></button><button class=\"practice-option\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>C</span><b>Make save, discard, delete, and reset password all navigation links</b></button></fieldset></section><section class=\"practice-detail-column\" aria-label=\"Related term guide\"><header class=\"practice-run-head\"><div class=\"practice-loop-copy\"><span>Question 1</span></div><div class=\"practice-scope-picker\"><span id=\"_R_2cppbsnmivb_\">Practice area</span><div class=\"practice-scope-select\"><button aria-controls=\"_R_2cppbsnmivbH2_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_2cppbsnmivb_ _R_2cppbsnmivbH1_\" class=\"practice-scope-trigger\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"practice-scope-value\" id=\"_R_2cppbsnmivbH1_\">All areas (334)</span><i class=\"practice-scope-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div></div></header><div class=\"practice-term-panel is-locked\"><div class=\"practice-detail-lock\"><i class=\"ti ti-eye-off\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Answer correctly to v